# Downstream carry: the operator deletes the Sentinel or Redis PDB it created
# once disablePodDisruptionBudget is set for that component. v3.3.5 only stops
# ensuring the PDB, and its owner reference removes it only together with the
# RedisFailover, so an instance scaled down to one Sentinel keeps a
# minAvailable: 1 PDB that blocks every drain. A PDB this RedisFailover does
# not control is left alone, and no delete is sent when there is no PDB.
#
# Its context includes the tlsHash parameter tls.diff adds, so it applies
# after that patch. Retire it when a release carrying the upstream pull
# request lands.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/freshworks-oss/redis-operator/pull/93
